**/.eslintrc.json

# LWC Jest tests. Without this line the deploy tries to COMPILE the test file as part of the
# bundle and fails on "Invalid LWC imported identifier createElement" -- a confusing error with a
# one-line fix, and the reason this entry is in every sfdx project template.
**/__tests__/**
